  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The colour of the <math><msub><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> molecules of group 17 elements changes gradually from yellow to violet down the group. This is due to -",
