  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Halogens are coloured due to HOMO-LUMO transition of electrons.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/23_solu_chem_pa1.jpg\"/></p><p>On moving down the group HOMO-LUMO energy gap decreases so transition of electrons become easier from  <math><msub><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></math> to <math><msub><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></math> therefore colour intensify.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
